current scripts:

    prebsd fetch      download bootable images and tapes
    prebsd run        boot an image on simh and drive the console
    prebsd mount      mount an image (wrap filsysmount)

Mapping from today's tooling:

    fetch               -> prebsd fetch
    boot.py             -> prebsd run
    vax/tdcopy.py       -> prebsd fetch / run   (32V tape -> disk)
    vax/install32v.py   -> prebsd fetch / run   (32V install)
    vax/extract.py      -> prebsd fetch / run   (extract root from tape)
    vax/vaxdrive.py     -> prebsd run           (VAX console driver)

